\par
## Technical Recommendations\par
\par
### Recommended Tech Stack\par
\par
**Option 1: Flutter (Recommended)**\par
- Best performance for instant UI\par
- True cross-platform\par
- Native feel\par
- SQLite integration: `sqflite` package\par
- No bridge overhead\par
\par
**Option 2: React Native**\par
- More familiar if David knows React\par
- SQLite: `expo-sqlite`\par
- Good performance with bare workflow\par
\par
### Storage & Export\par
\par
**Local Storage:**\par
- SQLite database\par
- No cloud sync initially\par
- Fast, reliable, proven\par
\par
**Data Export:**\par
- CSV format\par
- Export all tables\par
- Include readable timestamps\par
- Option to export date ranges\par
\par
### Performance Requirements\par
\par
**Critical: App must feel instant**\par
- Database queries < 50ms\par
- UI renders < 16ms (60fps)\par
- No loading spinners for normal operations\par
- No animations (per user requirement)\par
- Background processes minimized\par
\par
